{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00982","headline":"横吹曲辞 折杨柳 · 翁绶","name":"横吹曲辞 折杨柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫陌金堤映绮罗，游人处处动离歌。\n阴移古戍迷荒草，花带残阳落远波。\n台上少年吹白雪，楼中思妇敛青蛾。\n殷勤攀折赠行客，此去关山雨雪多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}